	(text "Five independent active-low buttons with 10k pull-ups, so any mechanical layout uses the same firmware.\nPROVISIONAL: switch type is chosen for the schematic only; mechanics are not final.\nDRV2605L at 0x5A on 3V3. REG needs 1 uF, VDD needs 1 uF per datasheet. VDD/NC tied to VDD.\nIN/TRIG must not float: R96 holds it low until firmware drives GP3.\nISOLATION: remove R94, R95, R97, R98 and R99 to use a Qwiic DRV2605L breakout instead.\nMotor is off-board and must suit 3.3 V: confirm its rated voltage and current when selected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "981aef6e-3d09-5079-9449-f746f0fe9a9d")
	)
